## Why This Is Asked
This tests designing a compliant, scalable, multi-tenant cca_score system with strong isolation and auditability.

## Key Concepts
- Tenant isolation via partitioned feature stores
- Per-tenant key management and encryption
- Explainability safety and PII redaction
- Immutable auditing and breach-testing

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudocode: tenant-scoped scoring
function scoreForTenant(tenantId, payload, store, modelReg) {
  const part = store.getPartition(tenantId);
  const features = part.fetchFeatures(payload);
  const model = modelReg.getModel(tenantId);
  return model.predict(features);
}
```

